      "message": "The preferred method would probably be to create a new tcpm_* API in tcpm.h.  You could use something like tcpm_set_src_ctrl() as an example.\n\nSo you\u0027d: \n-Create the tcpm_* API\n-Convert the TCPC Vbus read to use this API and convert the existing tcpc_get_vbus_voltage\n-Add a .get_vbus_voltage entry to the NCT driver to use this new function\n\nThis prevents us from creating multiple implementations of tcpc_get_vbus_voltage() which would be unusable if, for example, a board used two different TCPCs on two different ports.",
